  "repairs": {
    "signals": "Shared ref-counted main-thread SIGTERM scope cancels all registered diagnostic owners. Existing shielded cleanup tasks remain alive through repeated signals. Previous handlers restore after the last owner exits; CLI cancellation returns 143.",
