    "profiler": "Default controlled_database now owns a private root, delegates inner allocation deletion, then reconciles after generator.close even when close raises. Stop errors remain visible.",
    "ownership": "Reconciliation checks owned root boundaries, postmaster.pid data identity and the matching postgres -D command before bounded immediate stop. Uncertain identity/failure retains metadata and raises."
  },
